            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Classic Tactical RPG Adventure — Completely Free!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead an army. Defend a kingdom. Shape the fate of two generations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the golden age of 16-bit strategy RPGs, <strong>Clarent Saga: Tactics</strong> delivers a classic fantasy adventure filled with tactical battles, memorable characters, and customizable challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of Prince Abel of Meyr's forces as the invading armies of Pherrelios threaten his homeland. Meanwhile, the mysterious Cult of Brax seeks to resurrect Brax, the fallen god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War is coming, and the fate of the continent hangs in the balance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Turn-Based Tactical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position your units, exploit your enemies' weaknesses, and carefully plan your moves across a variety of battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fast-paced strategic encounters and a wide range of difficulty options, Clarent Saga: Tactics welcomes both newcomers and experienced tactical RPG players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely Free:</strong> Experience the full tactical RPG adventure without an upfront purchase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>28 Playable Characters:</strong> Assemble your army and discover a diverse cast of heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>42 Battle Maps:</strong> Fight through 35 main maps and 7 additional maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three-Part Story:</strong> Follow a fantasy conflict spanning two generations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Difficulty:</strong> Adjust the challenge with eight difficulty presets and additional gameplay options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Tutorial:</strong> Learn the fundamentals of tactical combat before taking on tougher challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16-Bit Inspiration:</strong> Rediscover the spirit of classic strategy RPGs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A War Across Generations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The armies of Pherrelios threaten the kingdom of Meyr, but an even greater danger lurks in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Prince Abel fights to protect his people, the Cult of Brax plots to resurrect an ancient fallen god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story of war, ambition, and the struggle against a growing darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the Clarent Saga Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clarent Saga: Tactics is the third entry in the Clarent Saga series, offering its own tactical RPG experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for more adventures in this fantasy universe? Discover <strong>Clarent Saga: Prologue</strong>, a short action RPG, and <strong>Clarent Saga: Chronicles</strong>, a story-rich JRPG with turn-based battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your army. Choose your strategy. Begin your adventure — for free!</strong></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Classic Tactical RPG Adventure — Completely Free!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead an army. Defend a kingdom. Shape the fate of two generations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the golden age of 16-bit strategy RPGs, <strong>Clarent Saga: Tactics</strong> delivers a classic fantasy adventure filled with tactical battles, memorable characters, and customizable challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of Prince Abel of Meyr's forces as the invading armies of Pherrelios threaten his homeland. Meanwhile, the mysterious Cult of Brax seeks to resurrect Brax, the fallen god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War is coming, and the fate of the continent hangs in the balance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Turn-Based Tactical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position your units, exploit your enemies' weaknesses, and carefully plan your moves across a variety of battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fast-paced strategic encounters and a wide range of difficulty options, Clarent Saga: Tactics welcomes both newcomers and experienced tactical RPG players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely Free:</strong> Experience the full tactical RPG adventure without an upfront purchase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>28 Playable Characters:</strong> Assemble your army and discover a diverse cast of heroes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>42 Battle Maps:</strong> Fight through 35 main maps and 7 additional maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three-Part Story:</strong> Follow a fantasy conflict spanning two generations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Difficulty:</strong> Adjust the challenge with eight difficulty presets and additional gameplay options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Tutorial:</strong> Learn the fundamentals of tactical combat before taking on tougher challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16-Bit Inspiration:</strong> Rediscover the spirit of classic strategy RPGs.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A War Across Generations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The armies of Pherrelios threaten the kingdom of Meyr, but an even greater danger lurks in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Prince Abel fights to protect his people, the Cult of Brax plots to resurrect an ancient fallen god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a story of war, ambition, and the struggle against a growing darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the Clarent Saga Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clarent Saga: Tactics is the third entry in the Clarent Saga series, offering its own tactical RPG experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for more adventures in this fantasy universe? Discover <strong>Clarent Saga: Prologue</strong>, a short action RPG, and <strong>Clarent Saga: Chronicles</strong>, a story-rich JRPG with turn-based battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your army. Choose your strategy. Begin your adventure — for free!</strong></p>",
